mental DMG Bonus."}],"a":[{"names":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"text":"Provides 18% ATK and boosts Stellar-Conduct DMG by 40%, with 16% CR against affected enemies. Wriothesley’s best-in-slot set for Stellar-Conduct teams.","stats":"ATK% - ATK% - CR / CD J"},{"names":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"text":"Provides 15% Normal and Charged Attack DMG and up to 36% CR when HP fluctuates. Wriothesley’s best-in-slot set for traditional Freeze and Melt teams.","stats":""},{"names":["Blizzard Strayer"],"text":"Provides 15% Cryo DMG and up to 40% CR against Cryo-affected or Frozen enemies. A strong option for Freeze teams, but Wriothesley’s Charged Attacks can Shatter enemies and reduce Freeze uptime.","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"Conducted Chaos","members":["Wriothesley","Odette","Mitya","Nicole"],"text":"Wriothesley leads on-field Stellar-Conduct damage, Mitya adds off-field Electro damage, Odette enables and buffs Stellar-Conduct, and Nicole provides shielding and teamwide ATK buffs.","roles":["Main DPS","Stellar","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Freeze Frame","members":["Wriothesley","Furina","Shenhe","Escoffier"],"text":"Wriothesley leads on-field Cryo damage, Furina provides Hydro and a massive teamwide DMG Bonus, Shenhe boosts Cryo damage, and Escoffier heals while shredding Cryo/Hydro RES.","roles":["Main DPS","Buffs","Support","Support"]},{"name":"Fire Meets Frost","members":["Wriothesley","Durin","Xilonen","Nicole"],"text":"Wriothesley drives on-field Melt damage, Durin provides Pyro application, Nicole delivers teamwide ATK buffs, and Xilonen shreds Cryo/Pyro RES while boosting damage.","roles":["Main DPS","Sub DPS","Buffs","Support"]},{"name":"Frost on a Budget","members":["Wriothesley","Xiangling","Sucrose","Bennett"],"text":"Wriothesley drives Reverse Melt damage, Xiangling provides off-field Pyro, Sucrose shares EM and shreds Cryo RES, and Bennett supplies ATK buffs, healing, and Pyro energy.","roles":["Main DPS","Sub DPS","EM Build","Support"]}],"v":"Freeze Cryo C